{
  "slug": "claude-plugin-product-management",
  "name": "Claude Plugin Product Management",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "A product management plugin for Claude that helps you draft clear, shippable product docs faster. It generates PRDs, user stories with acceptance criteria, stakeholder updates, and prioritization frameworks (RICE, competitive analysis, positioning) with structured outputs and practical checklists. Use it to turn messy inputs into crisp specs, align cross‑functional teams, and keep your thinking consistent across artifacts.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **28 skills** and **10 commands**.\n\n- **Skills** (28): `ab-test-designer` (Design robust A/B test experiments), `breadboarding` (Turn a shaped solution into a breadboard: user actions, UI affordances, system responsibilities, and wiring so it can…), `competitive-analysis-framework` (Create detailed competitive analysis and positioning), `design-sprint` (Use when asked to \"run a design sprint\", \"5-day sprint\", \"prototype in a week\", \"test ideas before building\",…), `feature-prioritization-assistant` (Calculate RICE scores and prioritize features systematically), `growth-loops` (Use when asked to \"growth loops\", \"build a growth engine\", \"design a viral loop\", \"create a content loop\",…), `hierarchy-of-engagement` (Use when asked to \"define our core action\", \"North Star metric\", \"accruing benefits\", \"improve retention mechanics\", \"hierarchy of…), `hierarchy-of-marketplaces` (Use when asked about \"marketplace strategy\", \"chicken and egg problem\", \"liquidity\", \"two-sided market\", \"tipping a marketplace\", \"GMV growth\",…), and 20 more\n- **Commands** (10): `competitive-intel`, `discover`, `growth`, `okr-planning`, `plan-launch`, `pricing`, `README`, `strategy`, and 2 more\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install claude-plugin-product-management@claude-community` from `pmprompt/claude-plugin-product-management`.",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude"
  ],
